@startuml secuencia-minuto
title Secuencia — Un minuto de simulación (hilos concurrentes)
skinparam shadowing false
participant "sgmms-clock" as Clock
participant "sgmms-generator" as GenT
participant "sgmms-indicators" as IndT
participant Simulation as Sim
participant CivilianTraffic as Traffic
participant AccidentDetector as AD
participant IncidentGenerator as IG
participant DispatchCenter as DC
participant "JavaFX\nApplication Thread" as FX

== cada minuto ==
Clock -> Sim : clockTick()
activate Sim
Sim -> Traffic : step(map) → CarMove[]
Sim -> DC : advanceMinute() (mueve vehículos, llegadas)
Sim -> DC : updateTraffic(posiciones)
note right of DC : congestión por distrito →\npesos del grafo de tráfico
Sim -> AD : detect(map, moves, busy, minute, random)
AD --> Sim : AccidentReport[]
loop por cada accidente
  Sim -> DC : reportIncident(ACCIDENT, lugar, gravedad)
end
deactivate Sim

== medio minuto después ==
GenT -> Sim : generationTick()
activate Sim
Sim -> IG : tick(center, settings, random, minute)
IG -> DC : reportIncident(ROBBERY | FIRE, …)
deactivate Sim

== cada 250 ms ==
IndT -> DC : indicators(), pollEvents()
DC --> IndT : instantánea inmutable + eventos
IndT -> FX : Platform.runLater(onUpdate)
FX -> FX : refresca la pantalla activa
@enduml
